      `the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties?
      `the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first?
      `the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data?
