§ `Under Article 52`
-- SITUATION: This group arises only if the model meets the condition of Article 51(1), point (a) (notification, arguments), or the Commission has designated it (designation, reassessment); the form can first ask "Does your model meet the high-impact condition, or has the Commission designated it?".

