      `the model is a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that your model is a general-purpose AI model?
      `the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that your model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)?
