-- ====================================================================================================
-- seat questions of seat gpai from part P8 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P8 seat layer: a provider of a general-purpose AI model: whether the AI Office is competent for an AI system built on the model (Article 75(1)).
-- SEAT: a provider of a general-purpose AI model
--
-- Nothing here is new law: each question calls the layer-1 function of Articles 72 to 79 (P8-art72 to P8-art79) that answers it, and the keel
-- (aia-definitions, aia-timeline, aia-core) for the role facts and the dates. Every question takes plain inputs: a yes/no, a date, a number or
-- one of the keel's own choices, each with an @desc worded for the person asking. A question answers JUST value, or NOTHING where the text does
-- not decide it (the Regulation does not apply yet on the date asked, or the text is silent); a JUST FALSE is a "no" the text itself gives.
-- Questions are grouped by Article in the order of the text; the role question and the applicability questions come first.


§ `The role the person asking holds`

-- The role, worked out by the keel's definition; the other questions of this seat assume it.
@export Under Article 75, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, am I a provider of a general-purpose AI model within the meaning of Article 3(3) and Article 3(63)?
GIVEN `the party develops an AI system or a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop an AI system or a general-purpose AI model?
      `the party has an AI system or a general-purpose AI model developed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have an AI system or a general-purpose AI model developed for you?
      `the party places it on the market, or puts the AI system into service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you place it on the market, or put the AI system into service?
      `the party does so under its own name or trademark` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you do so under your own name or trademark?
      `the model is an AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your model an AI model?
      `it displays significant generality` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your model display significant generality?
      `it is capable of competently performing a wide range of distinct tasks` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your model capable of competently performing a wide range of distinct tasks?
      `it can be integrated into a variety of downstream systems or applications` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Can your model be integrated into a variety of downstream systems or applications?
      `it is used for research, development or prototyping activities before it is placed on the market` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your model used for research, development or prototyping activities before it is placed on the market?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 75, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, am I a provider of a general-purpose AI model within the meaning of Article 3(3) and Article 3(63)` IS
    (`Art 3(3) the party is a provider` `the party develops an AI system or a general-purpose AI model` `the party has an AI system or a general-purpose AI model developed` `the party places it on the market, or puts the AI system into service` `the party does so under its own name or trademark`) AND (`Art 3(63) the model is a general-purpose AI model` `the model is an AI model` `it displays significant generality` `it is capable of competently performing a wide range of distinct tasks` `it can be integrated into a variety of downstream systems or applications` `it is used for research, development or prototyping activities before it is placed on the market`)

§ `Which provisions apply on the date asked`

-- Calls the gate helper of P8-gate, which passes the group to the keel's `Art 113 the provision group applies`.
@export Under Article 72, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, does General apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 72, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, does General apply on the date asked` IS
    JUST (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)

§ `Article 75: Market surveillance and control of AI systems and mutual assistance`
-- Arises only if the AI Office is competent for the AI system (Article 75(1)), or the Commission arranges a third-party conformity assessment (Article 75(1e)).

-- Calls `Art 75(1) the AI Office is competent for the supervision and enforcement of the obligations in relation to the AI system`.
@export Under Article 75(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, is the AI Office competent for the supervision and enforcement of the obligations in relation to my AI system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the AI system is based on a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the AI system is based on a general-purpose AI model?
      `the model and the system are developed by the same provider, or by providers forming part of the same undertaking as that provider` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the model and the system are developed by the same provider, or by providers forming part of the same undertaking as that provider?
      `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I?
      `the AI system is referred to in point 2 of Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the AI system is referred to in point 2 of Annex III?
      `the AI system is provided by a law enforcement authority, a border management authority or a financial institution, in so far as it falls under Article 74(6)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the AI system is provided by a law enforcement authority, a border management authority or a financial institution, in so far as it falls under Article 74(6)?
      `the AI system is referred to in point 8 of Annex III as regards the administration of justice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the AI system is referred to in point 8 of Annex III as regards the administration of justice?
      `the AI system constitutes or is integrated into a very large online platform or very large online search engine designated in accordance with Regulation (EU) 2022/2065` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the AI system constitutes or is integrated into a very large online platform or very large online search engine designated in accordance with Regulation (EU) 2022/2065?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 75(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, is the AI Office competent for the supervision and enforcement of the obligations in relation to my AI system` IS
    `Art 75(1) the AI Office is competent for the supervision and enforcement of the obligations in relation to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the AI system is based on a general-purpose AI model` `the model and the system are developed by the same provider, or by providers forming part of the same undertaking as that provider` `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I` `the AI system is referred to in point 2 of Annex III` `the AI system is provided by a law enforcement authority, a border management authority or a financial institution, in so far as it falls under Article 74(6)` `the AI system is referred to in point 8 of Annex III as regards the administration of justice` `the AI system constitutes or is integrated into a very large online platform or very large online search engine designated in accordance with Regulation (EU) 2022/2065`

-- ====================================================================================================
-- seat questions of seat gpai from part P9 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744 -- P9 -- THE SEAT LAYER, Articles 80 to 112.
--
-- SEAT: a provider of a general-purpose AI model, with or without systemic risk.
--
-- This layer phrases the rules already encoded in the layer-1 modules imported above as the questions this person would ask
-- about the Articles of P9 (market surveillance of AI systems, complaints and explanations, enforcement of the rules on
-- general-purpose AI models, codes of conduct and guidelines, penalties, and the final provisions). Nothing here is new law:
-- each question calls one layer-1 function and builds the record that function expects (the `AI system`) in a WHERE from
-- the answers. The rules a question calls are the ones that carry the quotes, the glosses and the NOTHING/FALSE branches.
-- Every question except the role question takes `the date asked`, so the answer is the Regulation as it stood or will stand on that date; a question
-- about an AI system also takes the AI system's route, the date it was placed on the market and whether its design has been
-- significantly changed, for Article 111(2). A group that is not yet in application answers NOTHING, never JUST FALSE.
-- The applicability question of each group the seat meets is the first question of its group of Articles.
-- The seat's own role is asked once, in the role question, which calls the keel's definition and has no date (a definition
-- of Article 3 is not asked on a date here); the other questions assume it.
-- Powers and duties of an official (the Commission, the AI Office, a market surveillance authority, the European Data
-- Protection Supervisor, a Member State) appear only as what they mean to this seat.
§ `Under Article 80: the applicability question for the group General`

@ref Art 113
@export Under Article 80, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, does General apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 80, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, does General apply on the date asked` IS
    JUST (`Art 113 the provision group applies` General `the date asked` `the route to pass when no AI system is in question` `the date to pass when no AI system is in question` FALSE)

§ `The seat's role: Article 3(3) and 3(63)`

@ref Art 3
@export Under Article 88, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, am I a provider of a general-purpose AI model within the meaning of Article 3(3) and (63)?
GIVEN `the party develops an AI system or a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop an AI system or a general-purpose AI model?
      `the party has an AI system or a general-purpose AI model developed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have an AI system or a general-purpose AI model developed for you?
      `the party places it on the market, or puts the AI system into service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you place it on the market, or put the AI system into service?
      `the party does so under its own name or trademark` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you do so under your own name or trademark?
      `the model is an AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the model an AI model?
      `it displays significant generality` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it display significant generality?
      `it is capable of competently performing a wide range of distinct tasks` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it capable of competently performing a wide range of distinct tasks?
      `it can be integrated into a variety of downstream systems or applications` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Can it be integrated into a variety of downstream systems or applications?
      `it is used for research, development or prototyping activities before it is placed on the market` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it used for research, development or prototyping activities before it is placed on the market?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 88, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, am I a provider of a general-purpose AI model within the meaning of Article 3(3) and (63)` IS
    JUST ((`Art 3(3) the party is a provider` `the party develops an AI system or a general-purpose AI model` `the party has an AI system or a general-purpose AI model developed` `the party places it on the market, or puts the AI system into service` `the party does so under its own name or trademark`) AND (`Art 3(63) the model is a general-purpose AI model` `the model is an AI model` `it displays significant generality` `it is capable of competently performing a wide range of distinct tasks` `it can be integrated into a variety of downstream systems or applications` `it is used for research, development or prototyping activities before it is placed on the market`))

§ `Under Article 88(1)`

@ref Art 88(1)
@export Under Article 88(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, does the body that proposes to supervise or enforce Chapter V against me have the power to do so?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the body is the Commission` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is the Commission?
      `the matter is the supervision or enforcement of Chapter V` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the matter is the supervision or enforcement of Chapter V?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 88(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, does the body that proposes to supervise or enforce Chapter V against me have the power to do so` IS
    `Art 88(1) the body has the power to supervise and enforce Chapter V` `the date asked` `the body is the Commission` `the matter is the supervision or enforcement of Chapter V`

