      `the monitoring concerns a provider of a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the monitoring concerns a provider of a general-purpose AI model?
      `the actions are taken for the purpose of carrying out the tasks assigned to the AI Office under this Section` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the actions are taken for the purpose of carrying out the tasks assigned to the AI Office under this Section?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
