    `Art 89(1) the AI Office may take the necessary actions to monitor the effective implementation and compliance` `the date asked` `the monitoring concerns a provider of a general-purpose AI model` `the actions are taken for the purpose of carrying out the tasks assigned to the AI Office under this Section`

§ `Under Article 91(1)`

@ref Art 91(1)
@export Under Article 91(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may the Commission request me to provide the documentation or information?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the request is for the documentation drawn up by the provider in accordance with Articles 53 and 55` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the request is for the documentation drawn up by the provider in accordance with Articles 53 and 55?
      `the request is for additional information that is necessary for the purpose of assessing compliance of the provider with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the request is for additional information that is necessary for the purpose of assessing compliance of the provider with this Regulation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 91(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may the Commission request me to provide the documentation or information` IS
    `Art 91(1) the Commission may request the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned to provide the documentation or information` `the date asked` `the request is for the documentation drawn up by the provider in accordance with Articles 53 and 55` `the request is for additional information that is necessary for the purpose of assessing compliance of the provider with this Regulation`

