§ `Under Article 92(1)`

@ref Art 92(1)
@export Under Article 92(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may the AI Office conduct an evaluation of my general-purpose AI model?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the AI Office has consulted the Board` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI Office has consulted the Board?
      `the purpose is to assess compliance of the provider with obligations under this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the purpose is to assess compliance of the provider with obligations under this Regulation?
      `the information gathered pursuant to Article 91 is insufficient` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the information gathered pursuant to Article 91 is insufficient?
      `the purpose is to investigate systemic risks at Union level of general-purpose AI models with systemic risk` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the purpose is to investigate systemic risks at Union level of general-purpose AI models with systemic risk?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 92(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may the AI Office conduct an evaluation of my general-purpose AI model` IS
    `Art 92(1) the AI Office may conduct an evaluation of the general-purpose AI model concerned` `the date asked` `the AI Office has consulted the Board` `the purpose is to assess compliance of the provider with obligations under this Regulation` `the information gathered pursuant to Article 91 is insufficient` `the purpose is to investigate systemic risks at Union level of general-purpose AI models with systemic risk`

