      `the measure` IS A `Art 93(1) measure` @desc Which measure does the Commission request: take appropriate measures to comply with the obligations set out in Articles 53 and 54; implement mitigation measures; restrict the making available on the market, withdraw or recall the model; or another measure?
      `the request is necessary and appropriate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the request is necessary and appropriate?
