§ `Under Article 101(1)`

@ref Art 101(1)
@export Under Article 101(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may the Commission impose a fine on me?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the Commission finds that the provider acted intentionally or negligently` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Commission finds that the provider acted intentionally or negligently?
      `the provider infringed the relevant provisions of this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the provider infringed the relevant provisions of this Regulation?
      `the provider failed to comply with a request for a document or for information pursuant to Article 91, or supplied incorrect, incomplete or misleading information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the provider failed to comply with a request for a document or for information pursuant to Article 91, or supplied incorrect, incomplete or misleading information?
      `the provider failed to comply with a measure requested under Article 93` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the provider failed to comply with a measure requested under Article 93?
      `the provider failed to make available to the Commission access to the model with a view to conducting an evaluation pursuant to Article 92` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the provider failed to make available to the Commission access to the model with a view to conducting an evaluation pursuant to Article 92?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 101(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may the Commission impose a fine on me` IS
    `Art 101(1) the Commission may impose a fine on the provider of the general-purpose AI model` `the date asked` `the Commission finds that the provider acted intentionally or negligently` `the provider infringed the relevant provisions of this Regulation` `the provider failed to comply with a request for a document or for information pursuant to Article 91, or supplied incorrect, incomplete or misleading information` `the provider failed to comply with a measure requested under Article 93` `the provider failed to make available to the Commission access to the model with a view to conducting an evaluation pursuant to Article 92`

@ref Art 101(1)
@export Under Article 101(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, what is the ceiling of the fine the Commission may impose on me?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the total worldwide annual turnover of the provider for the preceding financial year in euros` IS A NUMBER @desc What was the total worldwide annual turnover of the provider for the preceding financial year, in euros?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under Article 101(1), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, what is the ceiling of the fine the Commission may impose on me` IS
    `Art 101(1) the ceiling in euros of the fine on the provider` `the date asked` `the total worldwide annual turnover of the provider for the preceding financial year in euros`

